# Part 1 – Tilde Expansion (`~`)

## Tilde Expansion Kya Hai?

**Tilde (`~`)** ek shortcut hai jo kisi user ki **Home Directory** ko represent karta hai.

Misal ke taur par:

```text
/home/root
```

ko aap sirf is tarah likh sakte hain:

```text
~root
```

Isi tarah:

```text
/home/techstart
```

ko likha ja sakta hai:

```text
~techstart
```

---

